+                    # n_train_para episodes does not fit in 24 GB, so each episode is forwarded and back-propagated on its own with
+                    # its loss divided by the number of episodes, and one optimizer step follows (gradient accumulation). DNPG's losses
+                    # are means over equal-sized episodes, so the averaged loss equals the joint one; BatchNorm batch statistics are
